: J2), so two are already out, plus yours, only one remains \u2014 very safe to discard.\n\nHowever, **T7** appears safer because no T7 has been discarded yet \u2014 all four are still live. But you have two T7s \u2014 risky to keep both unless planning a pung.\n\nBest choice: **Play J2** \u2014 it's an honor tile, only one copy left unseen, two already discarded by others, so highly unlikely anyone is waiting on it. Also, you don\u2019t have a pair of J2, and Dragon Pung isn't forming. It minimizes risk while clearing a less useful honor.\n\nAnswer: Play J2"}
